  "message": "Thank you for your patience. I checked your line and it appears you have used 15.1GB of data this month, which is slightly over your plan's 15GB data limit. When your data limit is reached, mobile data—including MMS—will stop working. To restore MMS and data, you can add more data (refuel) to your line for a small fee per GB. Would you like to add more data now? If so, please let me know how much (up to 2GB) you would like to add. The cost is $2.00 per GB."
